er Demons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543320/598e244945af86769bcc47c9853b1d7ae32e60ec.jpg"},{"name":"Hell\u2019s Gate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543320/c04b594bc59e9e8f066be800ea917339e55d3a43.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543320?t=1768555577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3543320?t=1768555577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543320/949c9210397d3b078c6655f3c34d28f3b2be3b7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768555577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543320/949c9210397d3b078c6655f3c34d28f3b2be3b7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768555577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"\u6625\u6ce5Chun Ni is a crime-themed narrative puzzle game where players take on the role of police detectives investigating various cases. The game may include case elements such as sexual assault/sexual violence, dismemberment/extreme violence, abuse, imprisonment, suicide, self-harm, bloody scenes and corpses, criminal acts, drinking, profanity, and other similar elements. All adult content is presented statically or narratively and cannot be actively operated by the player.\r\n\r\nThe game does not feature a \"jump scare\" design (suddenly jumping out to startle players), but the overall atmosphere leans towards horror."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u559c\u6b22\u60ac\u7591\u3001\u63a8\u7406\u3001\u89e3\u8c1c\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\uff0c\u8bf7\u5c06\u300a\u6625\u6ce5\u300b\u52a0\u5165\u4f60\u7684\